tred.\nThis warrior's once glowing armor now emits a sinister crimson light. As he marches towards your foes you can see his eyes, they are empty.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这位曾经沐浴在阳光下的战士，一位你曾经尊敬的勇士，现在已经被仇恨所吞噬。\n这个战士曾经闪耀着光辉的护甲已经被阴沉的血红色掩盖。他径直冲向你的敌人，只见他的眼神空洞无物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8f1f6a943bb4cb9d42623534f4de2567dc5cb14bce48663a907037148afa88fb","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"3381305fea527a65368df7d7b88acecb6c5c51e8cc9d6b47e202d18edc0d3104","logical_entry_identity":"5c976363c077975abda0379ca087864b85decb3545d2abf1de407dd0ecde56b4","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Next melee or ranged attack that deals more than 8%% of maximum life is reduced by %d%% and triggers a radius %d conal explosion dealing %d%% steamgun damage. %d stacks remaining.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"下一次受到的近战或远程攻击若造成至少相当于最大生命值 8%% 的伤害，则会降低 %d%% 伤害，并触发一次半径为 %d 的扇形爆炸，造成 %d%% 蒸汽枪伤害。每回合最多触发一次。剩余 %d 层叠加。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b5fcffe7cae1851608fa5d56265f54399a7465ff6035a27105d340d0e6ce9961","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"33b7376c607e1df4b424e49960a126027fa8e9552a51dbd88cc75d7d5706f6d3","logical_entry_identity":"394c171e271a43752ba12cdf17525a4398f0c8543eccbc823501be6343a12b7a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have tunnelled close enough to the Gates of Morning.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已经向北挖到晨曦之门的地方。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"76ebe4bc82d32e1ad89dd89a73c85f849ffb22fe1eed70cc780d432574a3ee4d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"33bacd7eae6210fa7fe9e125aaded0d77eaae953d1d75e74ed551d799686fd48","logical_entry_identity":"8d43e9e9dfae66b4442fd409e864574df3a9de23ef785c5f52bc23673b7d9724","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"But they are strong and will face whatever is needed to ensure a future of their own!","source_tag":"_t","target":"但他们意志强大，敢于直面任何磨难，来创造属于他们的未来！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e2307b2c92844dd10850d3666a8019d2317c3ba0c2